<view class="tech-page tech-page--detail"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-eyebrow">SERVICE RECORD</view><view class="tech-title">{{kind==='INSPECTION'?'记录现场检测':'记录维修过程'}}</view><view class="tech-subtitle">把真实情况写清楚，让服务有据可查</view></view></view><tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="记录暂不可填写" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view class="record-context"><van-icon name="service-o" size="20px" /><view><view>{{title}}</view><text>{{orderNo}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!canSubmit&&!pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue">当前任务没有提交此类记录的权限，请返回刷新任务进度。</view><view wx:if="{{pendingLabel}}" class="tech-notice">上次“{{pendingLabel}}”结果待确认，请先恢复。</view><view class="tech-card"><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">记录方式</text><picker range="{{correctionOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{correctionIndex}}" bindchange="onCorrection" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSubmit}}"><view class="tech-picker">{{correctionOptions[correctionIndex].label}}<van-icon name="arrow-down" size="12px" /></view></picker></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">{{kind==='INSPECTION'?'现场检测事实':'维修与复查情况'}}<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea" value="{{facts}}" maxlength="4000" auto-height placeholder="{{kind==='INSPECTION'?'请描述检查项目、实际现象、测量结果及判断依据。':'请描述实际维修项目、处理过程及复查结果，保持与已确认范围一致。'}}" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSubmit}}" data-field="facts" bindinput="onInput" /><view class="tech-counter">{{facts.length}} / 4000</view></view><view class="tech-field"><text class="tech-label">服务摘要<text class="tech-required">*</text></text><textarea class="tech-textarea tech-textarea--small" value="{{summary}}" maxlength="1000" auto-height placeholder="简明概括本次结果，方便客户与平台了解进度" disabled="{{busy||!!pendingLabel||!canSubmit}}" data-field="summary" bindinput="onInput" /><view class="tech-counter">{{summary.length}} / 1000</view></view></view><view class="tech-notice tech-notice--blue"><van-icon name="shield-o" /><text>请根据现场情况填写。已提交记录不能覆盖，发现遗漏时可追加修正。</text></view><view wx:if="{{submitError}}" class="tech-form-error">{{submitError}}</view></block><view class="tech-dock" wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&(canSubmit||pendingLabel)}}"><view class="tech-dock__hint">{{kind==='INSPECTION'?'检测提交后，按任务权限进入报价':'提交维修记录后，再按任务权限申请完工'}}</view><button class="tech-btn tech-btn--primary" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onMain">{{pendingLabel?'恢复上次提交结果':'确认提交记录'}}</button></view></view>
